; rexx: the ARexx port: the page's address, title, status and fields;
; a login form filled in and sent; unknown commands; QUIT
Echo >VELOX:r/rexx.txt "rexx"
Run >NIL: SYS:System/RexxMast
Run >NIL: VELOX:velox http://127.0.0.1:8080/rexxlogin.html LOG=VELOX:r/rexx.log
SYS:Rexxc/WaitForPort VELOX
Wait 8
SYS:Rexxc/RX VELOX:t/test.rexx >>VELOX:r/rexx.txt
Wait 3
Echo >>VELOX:r/rexx.txt "done"
